  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanidu, bea ya ngolo yapo na ilombi japo kwa Mlungu ni angu wamzedu wikie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu neko na wushuhuda aighu yawo kukaia wamkunde Mlungu na ndighi, ela weesowa kumanya kwa loli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu wiendakaia wiseimanyagha ija hachi ifumagha kwa Mlungu, na kulola kuimangisha hachi yawo cheni, ndewicheirumiria hachi ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Kristo nuo kutua kwa Sharia, eri uo ose urumiriagha utalo kukaia na hachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukia ni kwa wose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa oreandikieghe kukaia, mundu uo ose ubonyagha hachi kwa chia ya kuikatisha Sharia uchakaia moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hachi iko kwa chia ya irumirio yaghamba, Kusakeghamba ngolonyi kwako wei, “Nani ujokagha mlungunyi?” (huwo ni kumsera Kristo andoenyi)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.12+DEU.30.13+DEU.30.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 30.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu “Nani useagha andu kwa wafu?” (huwo ni kumjosa Kristo kufuma kwa wafu.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ighora wada? Iaghora, Ilagho jeko kaavui kwako, momunyi kwako na ngolonyi kwako; (ijo nijo ilagho ja irumirio dawuyajichila.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ngera kuchamghora Jesu kwa momu ghwako kukaia ni Bwana, na kurumiria ngolonyi kwako kukaia Mlungu wamrukishire kufuma kwa wafu, kuchakia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kwa ngolo mundu uarumiria, nao uatalwa kukaia na hachi; na kwa momu ghwake uaghora, nao uakirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maandiko ghaghamba, “Mundu uo ose urumiriagha kwake ndechaafushwa waya anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 28.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ndeghuko wuchumbano ghungi aghadi ya Myahudi na Mgriki anduangi; uo Bwana ni Bwana wa wose, nao wadawidiria marasimio ghake kwa wungi wose wimlombagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu, “Uo ose uchaajiwangia irina ja Bwana uchakia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joe. 2.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wandu wichajiwangia wada irina jake uo wisemrumirie? Nawo wichamrumiria wada uo wisemsikire jingi? Nawo wichasikira wada ngera mchili useko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wichila wada ngera wisedumilo? Sa iji iandikilo, “Kwaboie nandighi kucha kwa awo wandu wiredagha Ilagho Jiboie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 52.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela si wose wijirumirie ijo Ilagho Jiboie; angu Isaya waghambie, “Bwana, nani oreghirumirieghe malagho ghedu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 53.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo irumirio jiachanya na kusikira Ilagho, na jija Ilagho jiachanya na kumchila Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela niakotia, da loli ndewisikire? Loli wasikire putu, angu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
